            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>puzzlez - a shapez game</i> is a puzzle game about constructing shapes in compact and atmospheric 3D environments. Easy to learn but hard to master, each puzzle is a small production line waiting to be solved not with efficiency, but ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/fecfef0f59f2baea15212bcbbb723917.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/fecfef0f59f2baea15212bcbbb723917.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span>With step-by-step onboarding and accessible mechanics, anyone can get started. Solve over 75 handcrafted puzzles. Start with simple production chains and work your way up to head-scratching logistical problems spanning multiple building layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/6d52e197aaa04d82deaf1bbef6967929.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/6d52e197aaa04d82deaf1bbef6967929.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span>Focus entirely on the puzzle in front of you, at your own pace, supported by calming visuals and sound design. With multiple ways to solve each puzzle, compare your approach to the community through statistics to see how you fared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/0ba46e6c2288f392b3651446a0cc2972.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/0ba46e6c2288f392b3651446a0cc2972.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span>And that's just the start. The same creation tools used to build these puzzles are available to you as well! Design your very own puzzles, share them with the community, and test yourself against others' creations. Be part of a puzzle community like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>puzzlez - a shapez game</i> welcomes puzzle fans of every kind, seasoned and new alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/2eddc198334955680eff48547fdc5e95.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/2eddc198334955680eff48547fdc5e95.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 75 handcrafted 3D automation and logic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles ranging from simple problems to complex brain-twisters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact and atmospheric 3D visuals and a relaxing soundscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles your way, track how well you did, and compare with others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, create and share your own puzzles using the built-in puzzle editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and play an ever-growing in-game library of community-made puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>puzzlez - a shapez game</i> is a puzzle game about constructing shapes in compact and atmospheric 3D environments. Easy to learn but hard to master, each puzzle is a small production line waiting to be solved not with efficiency, but ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/fecfef0f59f2baea15212bcbbb723917.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/fecfef0f59f2baea15212bcbbb723917.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span>With step-by-step onboarding and accessible mechanics, anyone can get started. Solve over 75 handcrafted puzzles. Start with simple production chains and work your way up to head-scratching logistical problems spanning multiple building layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/6d52e197aaa04d82deaf1bbef6967929.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/6d52e197aaa04d82deaf1bbef6967929.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span>Focus entirely on the puzzle in front of you, at your own pace, supported by calming visuals and sound design. With multiple ways to solve each puzzle, compare your approach to the community through statistics to see how you fared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/0ba46e6c2288f392b3651446a0cc2972.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/0ba46e6c2288f392b3651446a0cc2972.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span>And that's just the start. The same creation tools used to build these puzzles are available to you as well! Design your very own puzzles, share them with the community, and test yourself against others' creations. Be part of a puzzle community like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>puzzlez - a shapez game</i> welcomes puzzle fans of every kind, seasoned and new alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras/2eddc198334955680eff48547fdc5e95.avif?t=1788861013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783760/extras_big/2eddc198334955680eff48547fdc5e95.webp?t=1788861013 width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 75 handcrafted 3D automation and logic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles ranging from simple problems to complex brain-twisters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact and atmospheric 3D visuals and a relaxing soundscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles your way, track how well you did, and compare with others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, create and share your own puzzles using the built-in puzzle editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and play an ever-growing in-game library of community-made puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
